+Why (2026-09-24): with the spotter alone, Room 214 woke on background speech
+("that area", "underneath her", "thirteen"). Synthetic check: spotter alone 22/30
+real wakes, 7/144 false; with verification 17/30 real, 0/144 false (+~0.6 s).
+If the verifier model cannot load, the listener fails closed (never wakes)
+unless `ARIA_WAKE_VERIFY=0`.
 
